  "notes": "账户活动与月度回忆\n\n- 我的页面新增机构组团和月度回忆入口。\n- 组团支持验证机构邮箱、阅读规则、报名、退出和申诉；服务器统一计算资格与奖励，提现走官网原流程。\n- 回忆默认关闭，可分别选择生成和通知；仅展示可核实的数据，缺失数据明确标注。\n- 商店版保留月度回忆，不展示现金组团入口和对应消息。\n- 继续使用现有稳定内核，保留 1.3.96 的线路页面精简和连接稳定性修正。\n",
  "notesEn": "Activities and monthly memories\n\n- Added institution team activities and monthly memories to your account page.\n- Verify an institution email, review the rules, join, leave or appeal. Eligibility and rewards come from the server; withdrawals use the website.\n- Memories are off by default, with separate generation and notification choices. Missing facts remain visibly unavailable.\n- Store editions retain memories and hide cash activity entries and messages.\n- Retains the stable core and the connection improvements released in 1.3.96.\n",
